<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers 10 discount T-bill issues May 5-9.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers 10 discount T-bill issues May 5-9.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer 10 discount T-bill issues with no minimum acceptable prices set in advance and a total par value of 285 billion levs at auctions this week, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Five issues have a maturity of one week and a par value of 12 billion levs each while the others have a four-week maturity and par values of 45 billion levs each.</p>
<p>Details of the issues follow:</p>
<p> ISSUE NUMBER     AUCTION DATE     ISSUE DATE    MATURITY DATE</p>
<p> BG3031797007	   May 5	     May 6	    May 13</p>
<p> BG3031897005	   May 5	     May 6	    June 3</p>
<p> BG3031997003	   May 6	     May 7	    May 14</p>
<p> BG3032097001	   May 6	     May 7	    June 4</p>
<p> BG3032197009	   May 7	     May 8	    May 15</p>
<p> BG3032297007	   May 7	     May 8	    June 5</p>
<p> BG3032397005	   May 8	     May 9	    May 16</p>
<p> BG3032497003	   May 8	     May 9	    June 6</p>
<p> BG3032597000	   May 9	     May 12	   May 19</p>
<p> BG3032697008	   May 9	     May 12	   June 9</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
